  "turns": [
    {
      "_id": "0",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "role": "TUTOR",
      "content": "This recipe uses flour and sugar in a 3 to 5 ratio, and we're told 12 cups of flour are used. We need to find the sugar.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t001",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:00:00.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:01:01.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "1",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 2,
      "role": "STUDENT_1",
      "content": "So the ratio is 3 parts flour to 5 parts sugar, we have 12 cups of flour, and we want the matching sugar amount.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t002",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:01:02.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:01:52.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "2",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 3,
      "role": "TUTOR",
      "content": "Good, so we both have the ratio and the flour amount clear before we go further.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t003",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:02:00.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:02:58.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "3",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 4,
      "role": "STUDENT_1",
      "content": "So how do we actually turn that ratio into a real amount of sugar?",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t004",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:02:58.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:03:32.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "4",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 5,
      "role": "TUTOR",
      "content": "Think about what one single 'part' of the ratio is worth in cups.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t005",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:03:39.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:04:30.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "5",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 6,
      "role": "STUDENT_1",
      "content": "So the plan is to figure out how many cups one part equals, starting from the flour side.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t006",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:04:34.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:05:23.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "6",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 7,
      "role": "TUTOR",
      "content": "Right, and once we know that, we scale it up to however many parts sugar needs.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t007",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:05:23.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:05:37.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "7",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 8,
      "role": "STUDENT_1",
      "content": "So the plan is: find one part from the flour, then multiply that by five for sugar.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t008",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:05:42.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:05:58.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "8",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 9,
      "role": "TUTOR",
      "content": "That's a solid plan, let's carry it out step by step.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t009",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:06:02.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:06:57.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "9",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 10,
      "role": "STUDENT_1",
      "content": "So flour is 3 parts of the ratio, and those 3 parts equal 12 cups.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t010",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:07:03.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:07:46.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "10",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 11,
      "role": "TUTOR",
      "content": "Right, so each of those 3 equal parts must be worth the same number of cups.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t011",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:07:47.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:08:16.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "11",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 12,
      "role": "STUDENT_1",
      "content": "If 3 parts together make 12 cups, then one part has to be 4 cups.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t012",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:08:21.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:08:45.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "12",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 13,
      "role": "TUTOR",
      "content": "Exactly, and since sugar is 5 of those same-sized parts, each is also 4 cups.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t013",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:08:49.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:09:01.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "13",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 14,
      "role": "STUDENT_1",
      "content": "So the sugar amount follows from taking those 5 parts at 4 cups each.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t014",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:09:03.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:09:42.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "14",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 15,
      "role": "TUTOR",
      "content": "That gives 20 cups of sugar needed for this batch of the recipe.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t015",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:09:42.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:09:59.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "15",
      "session_id": "demo-c-s02",
      "sequence_id": 16,
      "role": "STUDENT_1",
      "content": "And 12 to 20 reduces right back down to 3 to 5, so it fits the original ratio.",
      "turn_id": "demo-c-s02-t016",
      "start_time": "2026-01-20T16:10:00.000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-01-20T16:11:07.000Z"
    },
    {
      "_id": "16",
